C5. Frontend lib/monitoring.ts (new):
- `export const SENTRY_DSN = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN?.trim() || ''` and `export const RELEASE = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_RELEASE_SHA?.trim() || 'unknown'`.
- `export function maskPath(pathname: string)`: per segment, a UUID → ':id', and /^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,}$/ → ':token'; the query is dropped.
- `export function maskText(s: string)`:
  - emails → '[email]';
  - UUIDs → '[id]';
  - [A-Za-z0-9_-]{24,} → '[token]';
  - \d{4,} → '[n]';
