- `export function scrubClientEvent(event)`:
  - set request.url to origin + maskPath(pathname), and delete request headers, cookies and query_string;
  - delete user, breadcrumbs and extra;
  - mask exception values with maskText;
  - frames: delete vars and context;
  - allowed tags: route, digest, boundary, release.
- `export function reportClientError(error: Error & { digest?: string }, boundary: 'locale' | 'global')`: no-op without SENTRY_DSN; otherwise Sentry.withScope, setTags({ route: maskPath(location.pathname), digest: error.digest ?? 'none', boundary }), captureException(error). Wrap in try/catch.
- monitoring.test.ts (vitest): maskPath('/ro/requests/drafts/AbCdEf1234567890xyz') → '/ro/requests/drafts/:token'; UUID → ':id'; maskText removes email and phone; scrubClientEvent strips cookies and user.

